sluice, vb, makes -ceable; -ABLE 1.
===
**sluice,** vb, makes *-ceable*; ^^-ABLE^^ 1.
>>>

<<<
Slumber. Apart from mere substitutions of s. for sleep dictated by desire for poetic diction or dislike of the words that common mortals use, slumber is equivalent to the noun sleep with some adjective or the verb sleep with some adverb.
===
**slumber.** Apart from mere substitutions of *s.* for *sleep* dictated by desire for poetic diction or dislike of the words that common mortals use, *slumber* is equivalent to the noun *sleep* with some adjective or the verb *sleep* with some adverb.
>>>

<<<
but the choice of slumber instead of sleep,
===
but the choice of *slumber* instead of *sleep*,
>>>

